
tuna:
	maybe the tiniest
	C++ game framework

    imlobster (c) 2026
    MPL 2.0

current state:
	at the moment tuna is in public
	testing and may be unstable. open an
	issue or contribute if you find a
	bug!

description:
	tuna is a tiny c++20 game
	development framework that only
	implements a familiar OOP
	object-component architecture.

installation:
    cp ./tuna.hh ~/my/project/include/

handbook:
	you can find a tuna handbook
	translated to multiple languages in
	this repo! it will help you get to
	know tuna enough to make your first
	project.

